WEBVTT

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:07.730
Dividing Driver!

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:21.750
The space-bending energy
of the Dividing Driver is...

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:25.580
...as powerful as a
black hole in outer space.

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:30.510
I never thought I'd get the chance
to see a black hole right here on Earth.

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:34.510
But the technology is
actually quite simple.

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:38.760
It's no more than a combination of an
Arresting Field and Repression Field.

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:41.930
But because it's man
made energy...

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:45.020
...it's highly possible that the
balance could be broken.

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:49.730
If a foreign object were to enter the
space just as the Battlefield closed...

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:53.400
Are there any remedies
for such a situation?

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:03.160
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:06.060
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:13.010
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:17.060
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:23.780
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.060
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:32.980
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:36.900
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:39.700
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:43.460
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:01:45.610 --> 00:01:48.460
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:51.630
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:54.170
Final Fusion, approved!

00:01:54.370 --> 00:01:57.300
Now transform into a superhero!

00:01:57.300 --> 00:02:00.260
Warping dimensional space!

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:04.340
Dividing Driver!

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:11.980
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:17.860
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:20.810
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:20.810 --> 00:02:24.700
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:26.870
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:29.830
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:02:32.090 --> 00:02:32.130
Conqueror of Space

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:34.920
<i>Conqueror of Space</i>

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:10.460
Hey, how about an octopus ball?

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:12.330
Here you go!

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:17.090
Hey, you! What did you do to my baby?

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:18.880
Come on, get lost now! Shoo! Shoo!

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:21.430
But I didn't do anything...

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:40.110
Seriously, if I were a little athletic, I could do martial artists or something.

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:43.160
Nothing works out in the real world...

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:54.920
At last I've found you...

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:59.260
I've been looking for a human host like you...

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:02.930
Wha-wha-what are you talking about, lady?

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:05.970
This world has left you so unfulfilled...

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:08.510
Don't you wish you could just trample over everyone in it?

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:09.640
Huh?

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:12.140
Now then...

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:26.120
We're nearly done repairing HyoRyu and EnRyu.

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:29.450
Just one more step, checking their replacement parts.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:35.250
Repairs on the GaoMachines are also proceeding faster than expected.

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:42.090
In that case, the only thing we have to worry about is Gai, I suppose.

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:52.180
We had no idea that Hell and Heaven was taking such a toll on him.

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:59.400
But the problem is, even if you told him not to use Hell and Heaven...

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:01.280
...Gai would never listen.

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:05.110
What are we going to do?

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.700
Once the G-Tool's ready to go...

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:08.570
What?

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:22.260
Hey, so this is what they sent us from the U.S.?

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:24.090
The P-P-Priels...

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:25.420
They're called Pliers.

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:28.220
Oh, uh, right. Pliers, huh?

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:30.260
I'm starting up their A.I. systems now!

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:48.530
Okay, do you guys know who I am?

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:51.780
Good!

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:55.200
Starting now, I'll be commanding you three.

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:58.080
I'm head of the GGG Strategic Unit, Geki Hyuuma.

00:05:58.250 --> 00:05:59.500
Remember my name, boys!

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:23.610
Now then, go forth! My Lovely little Petit!

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:26.070
The city of Osaka awaits you...

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:30.660
GaoGaiGar, it's your move now.

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:35.660
The moment you defeat my Lovely Petit will be the moment of your death!

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:41.210
I'll see you later, Mom!

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:43.170
Be careful of the traffic, now!

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:53.600
Aren't your parents worried about you?

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:58.310
Well, I lied and said I was going to a friend's house to do my homework!

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:07.530
Having received a Zonder alert from young Mamoru...

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:12.660
...GGG immediately dispatched HyoRyu and EnRyu to the Osaka area.

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:32.340
Gai! Are you sure you can go?

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:34.350
I'm a cyborg, remember.

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:36.510
I'm a lot stronger than any human being!

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:39.180
Oh, no! The data's no good!

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:44.770
Gai! Whether or not you use Hell and Heaven is up to you.

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:47.570
There's one condition, you're to make a safe return!

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:50.190
That's an order! Understood?

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:51.570
Roger!

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:52.780
Gai!

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:55.200
If you disobey the Chief's order...

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:58.290
...I'll make you eat a ton of the konnyaku you hate so much, got it?

00:07:58.700 --> 00:07:59.870
Hey, that's really harsh!

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:03.870
Oh, wow!

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:05.880
Look at that, Ayame!

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:08.380
Hold on. Man, this is heavy!

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:10.880
Come on! We're finally here for the first time!

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:13.760
What's the point if we don't get a good look?

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:16.970
See, there's Osaka Station!

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:19.390
And that round thing is Osaka Dome!

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:21.770
See those lights over there? That's Dotonbori!

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:24.400
You sure know a lot about this place, Hana...

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:26.230
Of course! I looked it all up!

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:27.730
Huh?

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:29.690
What's going on?

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:06.310
EnRyu, don't you think it's about time you got the hang of landing?

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:07.810
Sorry!

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:11.650
HyoRyu and EnRyu have both landed in Osaka...

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:13.610
...and will now start extinguishing the fires.

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:17.320
EI-17 has arrived in Osaka Castle Park.

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:26.620
I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid...

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:54.650
Fusion!

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:07.330
GaiGar!

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:34.780
Chief!

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:37.440
Final Fusion, approved!

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:38.530
Roger!

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:40.110
Final Fusion...

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:42.530
Program, drive!

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:49.830
Final Fusion!

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:37.050
GaoGaiGar!

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:04.620
Come on! Hurry! Hurry!

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:38.940
Dividing Driver!

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:05.260
Come on, let's fight, Zonder Robo!

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:07.800
Zonder!

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:13.060
Who knew you'd dig such a deep grave for yourself?

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:15.480
You've walked right into my trap!

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:18.230
Farewell, GaoGaiGar!

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:45.880
That thing is like a lump of konnyaku!

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:48.840
What's he doing, absorbing my power and deflecting it back at me?

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:52.640
All right, then, how do you like THIS?

00:13:54.890 --> 00:13:57.810
Broken Magnum!

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:10.620
Broken Magnum doesn't work on him either?

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:11.740
Fine, then in that case...

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:15.040
Hell and Heaven!

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:17.920
Gai! Don't do it!

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:21.790
This is a Konnyaku Zonder I'm dealing with here, and it's a lot worse than...

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:23.550
...your konnyaku attack, Mikoto!

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:27.090
Don't worry! I'll just take care of this and be on my way home!

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:34.890
GaoGaiGar!

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:52.030
Gai!

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:56.250
No good, the Zonder core's falling...

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:00.040
Power Ladder!

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:01.380
Power Crane!

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:05.300
We have captured the Zonder core.

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:06.920
Man, that was a close shave!

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:10.260
I owe you one, HyoRyu, EnRyu...

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:13.970
Now, Private Mamoru, if you would Purify the core, please...

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:14.390
Okay!

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:21.150
Curatio!

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:24.860
Teneritas, sectio...

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:29.320
...salus, coctura!

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:47.000
What the...

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:49.170
What's going on?

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:53.640
GaoGaiGar?

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:58.220
You've walked right into my trap!

00:15:58.350 --> 00:16:00.810
Not even the powerful GaoGaiGar can hope...

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:03.690
...to extricate himself from that warped hyperspace!

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:09.190
Broken Magnum!

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:20.000
What the heck's going on?

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:22.920
Captain! I'm coming to save you now!

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:26.040
EnRyu! Hold on!

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:28.420
This is no ordinary cyclone!

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:30.760
What's going on?

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:33.260
I've rendered a conceptual diagram.

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:34.800
Take a look at the Main Screen.

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:37.390
What in the world is going on?

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:40.850
That's not organic energy we're seeing...

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:43.310
...it won't do any good to use the Eraser Head!

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:46.060
All communication with GaoGaiGar has been cut off!

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:49.110
The instant that Zonder Robo exploded...

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:53.950
The mix of enormous rotational energy and absorbing-diffusing energy...

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:58.700
...has created an inescapable vacuum, much like a black hole.

00:16:58.780 --> 00:17:01.080
This has never before been seen here on Earth.

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:04.080
The enemy was planning all along to...

00:17:04.210 --> 00:17:07.130
...trap GaoGaiGar inside that hyperdimensional pod.

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:08.460
This is unbelievable...

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:15.010
Utsugi, when is the Dividing Driver space set to auto-decompress?

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:16.300
About 30 minutes from now, sir.

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:17.840
I get it!

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:20.310
The moment the Dividing Driver space closes...

00:17:20.390 --> 00:17:23.270
...the repulsion effect from the hyperdimensional pod...

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:29.230
...will blast both GaoGaiGar and the city of Osaka into oblivion!

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:31.780
What are we to do?

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:33.530
A little under 30 minutes now...

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:35.490
No! We're running out of time!

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:37.410
This is terrible...

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:39.070
Gai!

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:46.870
This is no joke. There's no way out!

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:49.170
I've lost all outside contact...

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:50.500
Does this mean my number's up?

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:52.460
Now's the time to use the Pliers!

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:53.840
That's right!

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:57.180
The Pliers Dr. Liger sent us from the U.S., right?

00:17:57.340 --> 00:18:01.510
Right. Those are the very things we need in a situation like this!

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:05.060
Roger!

00:18:05.180 --> 00:18:06.390
Hey, you've got orders to mobilize!

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:11.860
I'm sending you to Osaka right away to rescue GaoGaiGar...

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:15.030
...as well as to dismantle that hyperdimensional pod.

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:16.150
Understood?

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:17.570
All right!

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:20.280
Mobilize, pliers!

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:34.800
They look kind of shaky, don't you think?

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:37.970
But there's no one else we can depend on right now!

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:44.180
The Pliers, Tool Robots developed to support GaoGaiGar...

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:48.850
...their sole purpose being to repair warped space...

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:07.540
The Dividing Field is about to start auto-decompressing!

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:10.460
All readings are stable. Now arresting-out.

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:12.380
We're out of time!

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:17.840
Any moment now, GaoGaiGar...

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:22.840
GaoGaiGar!

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:23.930
Special Agent Mamoru!

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:25.850
I'm not running away from this, okay?

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:29.230
Fine. Let us put our faith in them... the Pliers!

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:31.140
Huh? Pliers?

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:55.920
All right! Let us join the battle!

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:57.920
Okay!

00:19:59.970 --> 00:20:01.260
GunDober!

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:03.220
GunGlue!

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:10.980
Three Become One!

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:25.160
ChoRyuJin!

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:31.120
Big Volfogg!

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:44.470
You must be the Pliers my Uncle Liger sent over!

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:47.640
All right! I'm counting on you!

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:50.060
I need you to help me out here now!

00:20:54.390 --> 00:20:56.560
Dimensional Pliers!

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:02.570
Tool Connect!

00:21:27.760 --> 00:21:28.600
GaoGaiGar!

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:43.360
Good work, Captain.

00:21:45.400 --> 00:21:46.700
Thanks, all of you!

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:48.620
Thank you...

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:51.540
Decompression 100%! Exiting Arresting Mode!

00:21:51.700 --> 00:21:53.500
Yay!

00:21:54.200 --> 00:21:57.040
What marvelous tools, those Pliers!

00:21:57.620 --> 00:21:59.750
Utsugi, I'd like a cup of coffee, please...

00:22:00.090 --> 00:22:02.090
And brew it extra strong!

00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:03.510
Yes, Chief!

00:22:05.260 --> 00:22:07.720
Worthless pieces of junk! Those Pliers...

00:22:08.300 --> 00:22:11.260
But I do admit I was a tiny bit dazzled...

00:22:13.350 --> 00:22:15.430
Huh? Mamoru?

00:22:15.520 --> 00:22:17.730
What are you doing here?

00:22:17.810 --> 00:22:20.270
Waha! No, you're wrong...

00:22:20.440 --> 00:22:22.270
You must think I'm someone else!

00:22:22.320 --> 00:22:24.440
No way! No way! I know it's you, Mamoru!

00:22:24.530 --> 00:22:26.530
Hey, Hana!

00:22:28.410 --> 00:22:30.450
Thanks to the good job done by the Pliers...

00:22:30.530 --> 00:22:32.450
...GaoGaiGar was able to make a safe return.

00:22:32.580 --> 00:22:37.460
But with Hell and Heaven inflicting so much physical damage on Gai...

00:22:37.620 --> 00:22:41.790
...there is no guarantee that he will be victorious the next time around!

00:22:46.530 --> 00:22:50.430
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.630 --> 00:22:55.300
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.700 --> 00:23:01.480
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.480 --> 00:23:06.270
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.900 --> 00:23:10.440
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.610 --> 00:23:17.370
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.430 --> 00:23:24.130
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:24.130 --> 00:23:28.790
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:29.480 --> 00:23:34.130
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:34.130 --> 00:23:41.030
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.980 --> 00:23:49.320
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:50.200 --> 00:23:51.910
A mysterious Magician Zonder has...

00:23:51.990 --> 00:23:54.910
...created a crisis within the Space Development Corporation.

00:23:55.200 --> 00:23:58.910
And now even Mikoto has fallen into the enemy's hands!

00:23:59.250 --> 00:24:00.410
Get ready for battle, Gai!

00:24:00.540 --> 00:24:02.670
In order to find the key to victory...

00:24:02.870 --> 00:24:04.960
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:05.170 --> 00:24:07.210
"A Promise Made Beyond the Light"

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:10.420
A Promise Made Beyond the Light

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:10.420
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:15.220
GGG "Pocket Bell" Pager

00:24:12.930 --> 00:24:14.840
This is the Key to Victory!
